    "## TripoSG + Hunyuan3D-2.1 Paint on AMD\n\nImage in, textured GLB out (`ComfyUI/output/3d`). One object per image works best.\n\nExample input: [3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png) (put it in `ComfyUI/input`)\n\n**Models**\n\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors) in `models/background_removal`\n\nThese download on first run (about 18 GB, once):\n\n- TripoSG ([VAST-AI/TripoSG](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSG)) to `models/triposg/TripoSG`\n- Hunyuan3D-2.1 paint ([tencent/Hunyuan3D-2.1](https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hunyuan3D-2.1), `hunyuan3d-paintpbr-v2-1`) to `models/hunyuan3d/Hunyuan3D-2.1`\n- DINOv2 giant ([facebook/dinov2-giant](https://huggingface.co/facebook/dinov2-giant)) to `models/hunyuan3d/dinov2-giant`\n- [RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth](https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.1.0/RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth) to `models/upscale_models`\n\nInstall [SageAttention](https://github.com/TwelveNights/SageAttention-rocm) for the fast path.\n"
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## TripoSG + Hunyuan3D-2.1 Paint on AMD\n\nImage in, textured GLB out (`ComfyUI/output/3d`). One object per image works best.\n\nExample input: [3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png) (put it in `ComfyUI/input`)\n\n**Models**\n\n- [birefnet.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/BiRefNet/resolve/main/background_removal/birefnet.safetensors) in `models/background_removal`\n\nThese download on first run (about 18 GB, once):\n\n- TripoSG ([VAST-AI/TripoSG](https://huggingface.co/VAST-AI/TripoSG)) to `models/triposg/TripoSG`\n- Hunyuan3D-2.1 paint ([tencent/Hunyuan3D-2.1](https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hunyuan3D-2.1), `hunyuan3d-paintpbr-v2-1`) to `models/hunyuan3d/Hunyuan3D-2.1`\n- DINOv2 giant ([facebook/dinov2-giant](https://huggingface.co/facebook/dinov2-giant)) to `models/hunyuan3d/dinov2-giant`\n- [RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth](https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.1.0/RealESRGAN_x4plus.pth) to `models/upscale_models`\n\nInstall [SageAttention](https://github.com/TwelveNights/SageAttention-rocm) for the fast path.\n"
   },
